+|---|---|---|
+| `--threads 1` | cpu_record_ms ≈ 11.85 (12.122/10.900/12.533), **draws=30000** | cpu_record_ms ≈ 0.019 (0.020/0.018/0.018), **recordsIn=30000, drawsSubmitted=4** |
